---
layout: base.njk
title: "Recommended Gear"
description: "Gear that earned a BikeLabs recommendation — helmets, jackets, intercoms and tech we tested and would spend our own money on."
permalink: /shop/
---

<div class="listing-hero">
  <div class="listing-hero-inner">
    <span class="kicker">recommended gear</span>
    <h1 class="listing-title">Gear We'd Buy</h1>
    <p class="listing-desc">Everything below earned its place through testing, not sponsorship. Each pick links to the full review so you can see exactly how it was tested and where it falls short.</p>
    <div class="data-strip">
      <span>Independently tested</span>
      <span>No paid placements</span>
      <span><a href="{{ '/how-we-test/' | url }}">How we test →</a></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="listing">
  <div class="picks-note">
    <strong>Transparency note:</strong> when affiliate programmes are active, buying through our links may earn BikeLabs a small commission at no extra cost to you. Verdicts are settled before any links are added — several picks here earn us nothing at all.
  </div>

  {% set listItems = collections.reviews %}
  {% if listItems | length %}
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for article in listItems %}
    <article class="article-card">
      <a href="{{ article.url | url }}">
        {% if article.data.image %}
        <div class="card-img-wrap">
          <img src="{{ article.data.image | url }}" alt="{{ article.data.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <div class="card-img-placeholder"><span>{{ article.data.category or "Gear" }}</span></div>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag">{{ article.data.category or "gear" }}</span>
        <h2 class="card-title"><a href="{{ article.url | url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="card-excerpt">{{ article.data.description }}</p>
        <p class="card-meta">Full review · {{ article.date | dateDisplay }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
